dsh-one-click-launcher README · into the web profile (or any profile)：1. writes `~/.dsh/launch-dsh.bat`;
2. copies the two built-in whale icons next to it — `~/.dsh/DeepSeek Harness.ico` (black, default) and `~/.dsh/DeepSeek Harness Blue.ico` (blue `#4176e6`);
3. creates a **DSH Web** shortcut on your desktop with the black whale icon.
